  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You receive an integer array `nums`.\n\nOutput the bitwise **OR** of all **even** numbers in the array.\n\nIf there are no even numbers in `nums`, output 0.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n**Input:** nums = [1,2,3,4,5,6]\n\n**Output:** 6\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe even numbers are 2, 4, and 6. Their bitwise OR equals 6.\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n**Input:** nums = [7,9,11]\n\n**Output:** 0\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThere are no even numbers, so the result is 0.\n\n**Example 3:**\n\n**Input:** nums = [1,8,16]\n\n**Output:** 24\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe even numbers are 8 and 16. Their bitwise OR equals 24.\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= nums.length <= 100`\n* `1 <= nums[i] <= 100`",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
